DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Chicago Public Library\\nCost: free\\nAges: 0-60 mo
 nths\\nCategory: Film & Events\\n\\nJoin us for a screening where the comm
 unity decides what film we will view. We will have a choice of five differ
 ent movies\, in which our patron(s) will select the movie of the day. Make
  your voice known\, come out and join us. Community Cinema is at a branch 
 near you! Check out hundreds of other screenings at libraries across Chica
 go. Accessibility English subtitles for the deaf and hard of hearing will 
 be available for this screening.\\n\\nMore info: https://chipublib.biblioc
 ommons.com/events/6a175e1846d5f64f7dcd1911
LOCATION:Greater Grand Crossing\, 1000 E. 73rd St.\, Chicago\, IL 60619
URL:https://chipublib.bibliocommons.com/events/6a175e1846d5f64f7dcd1911
