 r\, an entrepreneurial soul who inherits his father's struggling hair busi
 ness. Unfortunately\, Calvin doesn't want to be the head honcho\, so he se
 lls the shop to a local loan shark---a move that greatly upsets his regula
 rs. © Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer\, Inc -- 102 minutes -- PG-13. Community Cinema
  is at a branch near yo\\n\\nMore info: https://chipublib.bibliocommons.co
 m/events/6a4e97737d04302f0016782d
